{"h":"<h1><strong>通量模式修复工作流程 v1.0</strong></h1><p>此工作流程旨在修复生成的无缝模式。图像以特定方式重建，并且<strong>修复</strong>用于纠正任何不匹配的边缘。在刚刚<strong>两个重涂步骤</strong>，您将获得几乎相同的图像，但具有无缝校正的边框。</p><p>📖 <strong>请阅读文章中更详细的工作流程细分：</strong><br><a href=\"https://civitai.com/articles/12870\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">通量模式修复工作流程 – 详细指南</a></p><p><strong>自定义节点：</strong></p><p>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">rg三舒适</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/shadowcz007/comfyui-mixlab-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfyui-mixlab-节点</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-KJNodes</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_essentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI_essentials</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/sipherxyz/comfyui-art-venture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">舒适艺术冒险</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/theUpsider/ComfyUI-Logic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI逻辑</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/giriss/comfy-image-saver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">舒适图像保护程序</a></p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<h1><strong>Flux Pattern Fix Workflow v1.0</strong></h1><p>This workflow is designed to fix generated seamless patterns. The image is reconstructed in a specific way, and<strong>inpainting</strong>is used to correct any mismatched edges. In just<strong>two repainting steps</strong>, you'll get an almost identical image but with seamlessly corrected borders.</p><p>📖 <strong>Read a more detailed breakdown of the workflow in the article:</strong><br><a href=\"https://civitai.com/articles/12870\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">Flux Pattern Fix Workflow – Detailed Guide</a></p><p><strong>Custom Nodes:</strong></p><p>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">rgthree-comfy</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/shadowcz007/comfyui-mixlab-nodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfyui-mixlab-nodes</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-KJNodes</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/cubiq/ComfyUI_essentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI_essentials</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/sipherxyz/comfyui-art-venture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfyui-art-venture</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/theUpsider/ComfyUI-Logic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">ComfyUI-Logic</a><br>🔹 <a href=\"https://github.com/giriss/comfy-image-saver\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">comfy-image-saver</a></p>"}}